OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAt Birmingham A&E, chaos erupts
OL,7,     Fwhen a man becomes aggressive,
OL,8,     Fbringing the waiting room to a
OL,9,     Fhalt. Security steps in to
OL,10,     Fde-escalate the situation, but is
OL,11,     Fhe willing to cooperate?
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA 52-year-old man complains of
OL,14,     Fneck and shoulder pains after
OL,15,     Fbeing thrown off his motorbike,
OL,16,     Fand a 40-year-old epileptic woman
OL,17,     Fhas collapsed with a dangerously
OL,18,     Flow breathing rate.
