OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FReturn of the dermatologists, with
OL,7,     FDr Dev Shah attempting to 'shell
OL,8,     Fout' a giant lipoma, while Dr Emma
OL,9,     FMcMullen tackles a pair of cysts
OL,10,     Fnicknamed Tweedledum and
OL,11,     FTweedledee.
OL,12,G0000 Britain's Hotel Murders
OL,13,     FIn a Harrogate hotel, staff find
OL,14,     FChenise Gregory has been brutally
OL,15,     Fstabbed, while her boyfriend is
OL,16,     Flifeless. A tragic murder-suicide
OL,17,     Fhas played out - leaving more
OL,18,     Fquestions than answers. (Ep8)
