OL,5,G0100 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FA Paul Gascoigne lookalike is
OL,8,     Fpulled over for speeding and
OL,9,     Fbullying other drivers, and a
OL,10,     Freckless driver reacts to being
OL,11,     Fstopped with a foul-mouthed
OL,12,     Ftirade.
OL,13,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,14,     FDuring the night at Barnsley
OL,15,     FCasualty, a pipe bursts, so
OL,16,     Fpatients must be relocated. Among
OL,17,     Fpatients the next day are Pete,
OL,18,     Fwho has dangerously low oxygen
OL,19,     Flevels.
